        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void themis::NeuralSparseRetrieval::addDocument</definition>
        <argsstring>(const std::string &amp;doc_id, const SparseVector &amp;sparse_vec)</argsstring>
        <name>addDocument</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::NeuralSparseRetrieval::addDocument</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const std::string &amp;</type>
          <declname>doc_id</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>const <ref refid="namespacethemis_1a3b7144a3e1721ebdce0f21b8dce7a0cf" kindref="member">SparseVector</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>sparse_vec</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Index a document with a pre-computed sparse vector. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Add Document.</para>
<para>If a document with the same <computeroutput>doc_id</computeroutput> already exists it is removed first, then re-indexed with the new vector. Negative term weights in <computeroutput>sparse_vec</computeroutput> are clamped to zero. If the number of non-zero terms exceeds <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_neural_sparse_retrieval_1_1_config_1a7f9999fc9f3e1f3d96dd9294b5a63c87" kindref="member">Config::max_terms_per_doc</ref></computeroutput>, only the top-weighted terms are kept.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>doc_id</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Unique document identifier (primary key). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>sparse_vec</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pre-computed sparse representation of the document.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">doc_id</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Identifier of the doc. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">sparse_vec</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
Calls: empty(), THEMIS_WARN(), find(), end(), eraseFromIndex(), erase(), sanitize(), THEMIS_DEBUG(). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
