        <type>std::vector&lt; <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_neural_sparse_retrieval_1_1_result" kindref="compound">Result</ref> &gt;</type>
        <definition>std::vector&lt; NeuralSparseRetrieval::Result &gt; themis::NeuralSparseRetrieval::search</definition>
        <argsstring>(const SparseVector &amp;query_vec, size_t k=0) const</argsstring>
        <name>search</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::NeuralSparseRetrieval::search</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const <ref refid="namespacethemis_1a3b7144a3e1721ebdce0f21b8dce7a0cf" kindref="member">SparseVector</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>query_vec</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>size_t</type>
          <declname>k</declname>
          <defval>0</defval>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Search using a pre-computed query sparse vector. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes <computeroutput>score(q, d) = Σ_t( q[t] * d[t] )</computeroutput> via inverted-index accumulation and returns the top-k results above <computeroutput>score_threshold</computeroutput>. Optionally normalizes scores to [0, 1] when <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_neural_sparse_retrieval_1_1_config_1a5b8502c5c19b8ec6015e4071f09aa9dd" kindref="member">Config::normalize_scores</ref></computeroutput> is true. Never throws.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>query_vec</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pre-computed sparse query representation. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>k</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Override for <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_neural_sparse_retrieval_1_1_config_1aeec5bba3aead4194d7c4bd59e498f684" kindref="member">Config::k</ref> (0 means use <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_neural_sparse_retrieval_1_1_config_1aeec5bba3aead4194d7c4bd59e498f684" kindref="member">Config::k</ref>). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Results sorted by score descending, limited to k. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
